orm and Terraform Enterprise - Experience with application servers like JBoss, Tomcat, and NGINX. Desirable: Experience with modern messaging systems, such as Kafka. Desirable: Experience with modern monitoring and logging solutions, such as Prometheus, Grafana, and Elastic Stack. Desirable: Experience with DNS and network management. Desirable: In-depth security knowledge.\n\nSkills: Kubernetes, Terraform, I AM, JBoss Application Server, GitLab",
